# 17. What Happens After DNS?

Once the browser receives the IP address:

```
DNS

↓

TCP Three-Way Handshake

↓

TLS Handshake (HTTPS)

↓

HTTP Request

↓

Server Response
```

DNS is complete after the IP address is found.

