# 19. Common DNS Problems

## DNS Cache Poisoning

Attackers insert fake DNS records into a cache.

Result:

```
google.com

↓

Malicious Server
```

Protection:

* DNSSEC
* Trusted DNS providers

---

## DNS Spoofing

A fake DNS response redirects users to malicious websites.

---

## DNS Amplification Attack

A type of DDoS attack where attackers use open DNS resolvers to flood a victim with large amounts of traffic.

